Subject: [PATCH] fix(a11y): name section controls and bound health
 availability (LT-137)

Give Add section an accessible name and unique IDs while preserving styles.
Bound silent and trickling health responses to five seconds with fixed
unavailable feedback. Keep action and recovery semantics unchanged.

AI-Model: GPT-6 (Codex)
